notes = "Rooted clay meadow: a seamless rounded green shell with varied grass fans, a slim fern, and short round three/four-leaf clovers. Flowers are deliberately excluded. All dressing shares one vertex-coloured GPU wind surface with height-pinned roots and deterministic per-cell rotations. No extracted source geometry, texture, or material is used."
